						<span class="font-body" style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">Calcule ementas, serviço de mesa e bebidas por pessoa.</span>
					</a>
					<a href="/pt/day-of-timeline-generator" style="text-decoration: none; color: inherit; display: block; border: 1px solid var(--fg-pencil); padding: 0.75rem; border-radius: 4px; background: #fff;">
						<strong class="font-heading" style="color: var(--fg-pencil); display: block;">Gerador de Cronograma do Dia</strong>
						<span class="font-body" style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">Agende os momentos exatos de entrega dos envelopes de dinheiro.</span>
					</a>
				</div>
			</section>

			<!-- Section 4: FAQs (Centered Heading) -->
			<section>
				<h3 class="font-heading" style="font-size: 2rem; color: var(--fg-pencil); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; text-align: center;">
					Perguntas Frequentes
				</h3>

				<details class="faq-accordion" style="margin-bottom: 1rem; border: 2px solid var(--fg-pencil); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.75rem; background: var(--bg-paper);">
					<summary class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.2rem; cursor: pointer; color: var(--accent-blue);">
						O que fazer se um fornecedor prestar um mau serviço? É obrigatório dar gorjeta?
					</summary>
					<p class="font-body" style="margin-top: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.6; padding-left: 1rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-blue); font-size: 1.05rem;">
						Não. A gratificação para serviços que não a exigem contratualmente é totalmente discricionária. Se um fornecedor chegou atrasado, foi descortês ou falhou compromissos assumidos, não tem qualquer obrigação de lhe entregar gratificação.
					</p>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-accordion" style="margin-bottom: 1rem; border: 2px solid var(--fg-pencil); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.75rem; background: var(--bg-paper);">
					<summary class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.2rem; cursor: pointer; color: var(--accent-blue);">
						As gorjetas devem ser dadas em numerário ou por transferência / MB WAY?
					</summary>
					<p class="font-body" style="margin-top: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.6; padding-left: 1rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-blue); font-size: 1.05rem;">
						<strong>O dinheiro em numerário dentro de envelopes identificados é o formato ideal</strong>. O staff de sala, empregados de bar e motoristas dividem as gorjetas nessa mesma noite. No entanto, para fotógrafos ou coordenadores, um envio por MB WAY ou transferência no dia seguinte acompanhado de mensagem de agradecimento é perfeitamente aceite.
					</p>
				</details>

				<details class="faq-accordion" style="margin-bottom: 1rem; border: 2px solid var(--fg-pencil); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0.75rem; background: var(--bg-paper);">
					<summary class="font-heading" style="font-size: 1.2rem; cursor: pointer; color: var(--accent-blue);">
						Como exportar a minha lista de envelopes de gratificações?
					</summary>
					<p class="font-body" style="margin-top: 0.75rem; line-height: 1.6; padding-left: 1rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--accent-blue); font-size: 1.05rem;">
						Clique em <strong>"📝 Exportar Word (.doc)"</strong> ou <strong>"🖨️ Exportar PDF / Imprimir"</strong> no topo da página. A calculadora gera um documento completo com cada fornecedor, montante, quem entrega e o momento exato do dia para o fazer.
					</p>
				</details>
			</section>

		</article>

	</main>
</Layout>

<style>
	.vendor-input-group {
		background: var(--bg-paper);
		border: 1.5px solid var(--fg-pencil);
		border-radius: 4px;
		padding: 0.75rem;
	}
	.tip-input {
		width: 100%;
		box-sizing: border-box;
		padding: 0.45rem;
		border: 1.5px solid var(--fg-pencil);
		border-radius: 4px;
		background: #fff;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		font-weight: bold;
	}
	.tip-select {
		width: 100%;
		box-sizing: border-box;
		padding: 0.45rem;
		border: 1.5px solid var(--fg-pencil);
		border-radius: 4px;
		background: #fff;
		font-family: var(--font-body);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}

	.print-only {
		display: none;
	}

	
</style>

<script is:inline>
	let currencySymbol = '€';

	const currencySelect = document.getElementById('currency-select');
	const chkCatererIncluded = document.getElementById('chk-caterer-included');
	const inputCatererBill = document.getElementById('input-caterer-bill');
	const selectCatererRate = document.getElementById('select-caterer-rate');

	const inputBeautyBill = document.getElementById('input-beauty-bill');
	const selectBeautyRate = document.getElementById('select-beauty-rate');

	const selectPhotoLead = document.getElementById('select-photo-lead');
	const selectPhotoSecond = document.getElementById('select-photo-second');

	const selectDjTip = document.getElementById('select-dj-tip');
	const selectBandTip = document.getElementById('select-band-tip');

	const selectPlannerTip = document.getElementById('select-planner-tip');
	const selectDriverTip = document.getElementById('select-driver-tip');
	const selectOfficiantTip = document.getElementById('select-officiant-tip');
	const selectDeliveryTip = document.getElementById('select-delivery-tip');
	const selectCakeTip = document.getElementById('select-cake-tip');

	// Result Elements
	const resTotalGratuity = document.getElementById('res-total-gratuity');
	const resEnvelopeCount = document.getElementById('res-envelope-count');
	const resCatererTip = document.getElementById('res-caterer-tip');
	const resBeautyTip = document.getElementById('res-beauty-tip');
	const resPhotoTip = document.getElementById('res-photo-tip');
	const resDjTip = document.getElementById('res-dj-tip');
	const resPlannerTip = document.getElementById('res-planner-tip');
	const resLogisticsTip = document.getElementById('res-logistics-tip');
	const resDeliveryTip = document.getElementById('res-delivery-tip');

	const barCaterer = document.getElementById('bar-caterer');
	const barBeauty = document.getElementById('bar-beauty');
	const barPhoto = document.getElementById('bar-photo');
	const barDj = document.getElementById('bar-dj');
	const barPlanner = document.getElementById('bar-planner');
	const barOther = document.getElementById('bar-other');

	function formatMoney(amount) {
		const formatted = Math.round(amount).toLocaleString('pt-PT');
		if (currencySymbol === '€' || currencySymbol === 'CHF') {
			return `${formatted} ${currencySymbol}`;
		}
		return `${currencySymbol}${formatted}`;
	}

	function calculateTips() {
		currencySymbol = currencySelect.value;

		// 1. Caterer
		let catererTip = 0;
		if (!chkCatererIncluded.checked) {
			const bill = parseFloat(inputCatererBill.value) || 0;
			const rate = selectCatererRate.value;
			if (rate === 'flat') {
				catererTip = 30 * 10; // Cerca de 10 empregados
			} else {
				catererTip = bill * parseFloat(rate);
			}
		}

		// 2. Beauty
		const beautyBill = parseFloat(inputBeautyBill.value) || 0;
		const beautyRate = parseFloat(selectBeautyRate.value) || 0.15;
		const beautyTip = beautyBill * beautyRate;

		// 3. Photo / Video
		const photoLead = parseFloat(selectPhotoLead.value) || 0;
		const photoSecond = parseFloat(selectPhotoSecond.value) || 0;
		const photoTotal = photoLead + photoSecond;

		// 4. DJ & Band
		const djTip = parseFloat(selectDjTip.value) || 0;
		const bandTip = parseFloat(selectBandTip.value) || 0;
		const musicTotal = djTip + bandTip;

		// 5. Planner
		const plannerTip = parseFloat(selectPlannerTip.value) || 0;

		// 6. Drivers & Officiant
		const driverTip = parseFloat(selectDriverTip.value) || 0;
		const officiantTip = parseFloat(selectOfficiantTip.value) || 0;
		const logisticsTotal = driverTip + officiantTip;

		// 7. Delivery Crews
		const deliveryTip = parseFloat(selectDeliveryTip.value) || 0;
		const cakeTip = parseFloat(selectCakeTip.value) || 0;
		const deliveryTotal = deliveryTip + cakeTip;

		const grandTotal = catererTip + beautyTip + photoTotal + musicTotal + plannerTip + logisticsTotal + deliveryTotal;

		// Count active envelopes
		let count = 0;
		if (catererTip > 0) count++;
		if (beautyTip > 0) count++;
		if (photoLead > 0) count++;
		if (photoSecond > 0) count++;
		if (djTip > 0) count++;
		if (bandTip > 0) count++;
		if (plannerTip > 0) count++;
		if (driverTip > 0) count++;
		if (officiantTip > 0) count++;
		if (deliveryTotal > 0) count++;

		// Update UI
		resTotalGratuity.textContent = formatMoney(grandTotal);
		resEnvelopeCount.textContent = `Distribuído por ${count} Envelopes Identificados`;
		resCatererTip.textContent = formatMoney(catererTip);
		resBeautyTip.textContent = formatMoney(beautyTip);
		resPhotoTip.textContent = formatMoney(photoTotal);
		resDjTip.textContent = formatMoney(musicTotal);
		resPlannerTip.textContent = formatMoney(plannerTip);
		resLogisticsTip.textContent = formatMoney(logisticsTotal);
		resDeliveryTip.textContent = formatMoney(deliveryTotal);

		// Bar Chart
		if (grandTotal > 0) {
			barCaterer.style.width = `${Math.round((catererTip / grandTotal) * 100)}%`;
			barBeauty.style.width = `${Math.round((beautyTip / grandTotal) * 100)}%`;
			barPhoto.style.width = `${Math.round((photoTotal / grandTotal) * 100)}%`;
			barDj.style.width = `${Math.round((musicTotal / grandTotal) * 100)}%`;
			barPlanner.style.width = `${Math.round((plannerTip / grandTotal) * 100)}%`;
			barOther.style.width = `${Math.round(((logisticsTotal + deliveryTotal) / grandTotal) * 100)}%`;
		}
	}

	// Listeners
	document.querySelectorAll('.tip-input, #chk-caterer-included').forEach(el => {
		el.addEventListener('input', calculateTips);
		el.addEventListener('change', calculateTips);
	});
	document.querySelectorAll('.tip-select, #currency-select').forEach(el => {
		el.addEventListener('change', calculateTips);
	});

	// 📝 Export Word (.doc)
	document.getElementById('btn-export-doc').addEventListener('click', () => {
		let rows = '';
		if (parseFloat(resCatererTip.textContent.replace(/[^0-9.]/g, '')) > 0) {
			rows += `<tr><td><strong>Catering & Pessoal de Sala</strong></td><td>Final do Copo-d'água</td><td>Padrinho / Coordenador</td><td style="text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">${resCatererTip.textContent}</td></tr>`;
		}
		if (parseFloat(resBeautyTip.textContent.replace(/[^0-9.]/g, '')) > 0) {
			rows += `<tr><td><strong>Cabeleireiro & Maquilhagem</strong></td><td>Após Preparativos</td><td>Madrinha / Noiva</td><td style="text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">${resBeautyTip.textContent}</td></tr>`;
		}
		if (parseFloat(selectPhotoLead.value) > 0) {
			rows += `<tr><td><strong>Fotógrafo Principal</strong></td><td>Final da Reportagem</td><td>Padrinho / Noivo</td><td style="text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">${formatMoney(selectPhotoLead.value)}</td></tr>`;
		}
		if (parseFloat(selectPhotoSecond.value) > 0) {
			rows += `<tr><td><strong>2º Fotógrafo / Videógrafo</strong></td><td>Final da Reportagem</td><td>Padrinho</td><td style="text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">${formatMoney(selectPhotoSecond.value)}</td></tr>`;
		}
		if (parseFloat(selectDjTip.value) > 0) {
			rows += `<tr><td><strong>DJ / Animador de Casamento</strong></td><td>Fecho da Festa</td><td>Padrinho</td><td style="text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">${formatMoney(selectDjTip.value)}</td></tr>`;
		}
		if (parseFloat(selectPlannerTip.value) > 0) {
			rows += `<tr><td><strong>Wedding Planner / Coordenadora</strong></td><td>Final do Evento</td><td>Mãe da Noiva / Noivo</td><td style="text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">${formatMoney(selectPlannerTip.value)}</td></tr>`;
		}
		if (parseFloat(selectDriverTip.value) > 0) {
			rows += `<tr><td><strong>Motoristas de Transfer</strong></td><td>Após Último Transporte</td><td>Padrinho</td><td style="text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">${formatMoney(selectDriverTip.value)}</td></tr>`;
		}
		if (parseFloat(selectOfficiantTip.value) > 0) {
			rows += `<tr><td><strong>Celebrante / Paróquia</strong></td><td>Após Cerimónia</td><td>Padrinho</td><td style="text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">${formatMoney(selectOfficiantTip.value)}</td></tr>`;
		}
		if (parseFloat(resDeliveryTip.textContent.replace(/[^0-9.]/g, '')) > 0) {
			rows += `<tr><td><strong>Montagem Floral & Bolo</strong></td><td>Na Entrega Matinal</td><td>Coordenadora</td><td style="text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">${resDeliveryTip.textContent}</td></tr>`;
		}

		const html = `
			<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40">
			<head>
				<meta charset="utf-8">
				<title>Plano de Gratificações aos Fornecedores</title>
				<style>
					body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Arial, sans-serif; padding: 20px; }
					h1 { color: #2d2d2d; margin-bottom: 4px; }
					p { color: #555; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
					table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 13px; }
					th { background-color: #f2f2f2; border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
					td { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 8px; }
				</style>
			</head>
			<body>
				<h1>Manage.Wedding — Plano Oficial de Gratificações em Numerário</h1>
				<p>Gerado a ${new Date().toLocaleDateString('pt-PT')} | Total de Gratificações: <strong>${resTotalGratuity.textContent}</strong> (${resEnvelopeCount.textContent})</p>
				
				<h3>Distribuição dos Envelopes de Dinheiro:</h3>
				<table>
					<thead>
						<tr>
							<th>Fornecedor / Função</th>
							<th>Momento de Entrega</th>
							<th>Pessoa Responsável</th>
							<th style="text-align:right;">Montante em Numerário</th>
						</tr>
					</thead>
					<tbody>
						${rows}
						<tr style="background:#f2f2f2; font-weight:bold; font-size:15px;">
							<td colspan="3">Total em Dinheiro a Preparar</td>
							<td style="text-align:right; color:#b91c1c;">${resTotalGratuity.textContent}</td>
						</tr>
					</tbody>
				</table>

				<h3 style="margin-top:25px;">Checklist para o Dia do Casamento:</h3>
				<p>• Coloque o montante exato em envelopes etiquetados 3 a 5 dias antes do casamento.</p>
				<p>• Entregue todos os envelopes ao Padrinho de Casamento ou à Wedding Planner na véspera.</p>
			</body>
			</html>
		`;

		const blob = new Blob(['\ufeff', html], { type: 'application/msword' });
		const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
		const a = document.createElement('a');
		a.href = url;
		a.download = `Gratificacoes_Fornecedores_${new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10)}.doc`;
		document.body.appendChild(a);
		a.click();
		document.body.removeChild(a);
		URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
	});

	// 🖨️ Export PDF / Print
	document.getElementById('btn-export-pdf').addEventListener('click', () => {
		document.getElementById('print-date').textContent = new Date().toLocaleDateString('pt-PT');
		document.getElementById('print-total').textContent = resTotalGratuity.textContent;

		const tbody = document.getElementById('print-tipping-body');
		tbody.innerHTML = `
			<tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; font-weight:bold;">Catering & Pessoal de Sala</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;">Final do Copo-d'água</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;">Padrinho / Coordenador</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">${resCatererTip.textContent}</td></tr>
			<tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; font-weight:bold;">Cabeleireiro & Maquilhagem</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;">Após Preparativos</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;">Madrinha</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">${resBeautyTip.textContent}</td></tr>
			<tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; font-weight:bold;">Fotografia & Vídeo</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;">Final da Reportagem</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;">Padrinho</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">${resPhotoTip.textContent}</td></tr>
			<tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; font-weight:bold;">DJ & Músicos de Cerimónia</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;">Fecho da Festa</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;">Padrinho</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">${resDjTip.textContent}</td></tr>
			<tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; font-weight:bold;">Wedding Planner / Coordenadora</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;">Final do Evento</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;">Mãe da Noiva</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">${resPlannerTip.textContent}</td></tr>
			<tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; font-weight:bold;">Motoristas & Celebrante</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;">Após Serviços</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;">Padrinho</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">${resLogisticsTip.textContent}</td></tr>
			<tr><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; font-weight:bold;">Montagem Floral & Bolo</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;">Na Entrega Matinal</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px;">Coordenadora</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:right; font-weight:bold;">${resDeliveryTip.textContent}</td></tr>
			<tr style="background:#f2f2f2;"><td colspan="3" style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; font-weight:bold; font-size:13px;">Total em Numerário a Preparar</td><td style="border:1px solid #ccc; padding:6px; text-align:right; font-weight:bold; font-size:13px; color:#b91c1c;">${resTotalGratuity.textContent}</td></tr>
		`;

		window.print();
	});

	// 📊 Export Excel (.csv)
	document.getElementById('btn-export-csv').addEventListener('click', () => {
		let csv = "Funcao do Fornecedor,Momento de Entrega,Pessoa Responsavel,Montante\n";
		csv += `"Catering & Pessoal de Sala","Final do Copo-d'agua","Padrinho / Coordenador","${resCatererTip.textContent}"\n`;
		csv += `"Cabeleireiro & Maquilhagem","Apos Preparativos","Madrinha","${resBeautyTip.textContent}"\n`;
		csv += `"Fotografia & Video","Final da Reportagem","Padrinho","${resPhotoTip.textContent}"\n`;
		csv += `"DJ & Musicos","Fecho da Festa","Padrinho","${resDjTip.textContent}"\n`;
		csv += `"Wedding Planner","Final do Evento","Mae da Noiva","${resPlannerTip.textContent}"\n`;
		csv += `"Motoristas & Celebrante","Apos Servicos","Padrinho","${resLogisticsTip.textContent}"\n`;
		csv += `"Montagem Floral & Bolo","Na Entrega Matinal","Coordenadora","${resDeliveryTip.textContent}"\n`;
		csv += `"Total de Gratificacoes","--","--","${resTotalGratuity.textContent}"\n`;

		const blob = new Blob(['\ufeff' + csv], { type: 'text/csv;charset=utf-8;' });
		const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);
		const a = document.createElement('a');
		a.href = url;
		a.download = `Gratificacoes_Fornecedores_${new Date().toISOString().slice(0, 10)}.csv`;
		document.body.appendChild(a);
		a.click();
		document.body.removeChild(a);
		URL.revokeObjectURL(url);
	});

	// Initialize
	calculateTips();
</script>
